              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ti̱ti̱ kɛ kɛn ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl tëë ca kuɛn nikɛ dho̱r gua̱nikiɛn, kɛn diaal kɛ dho̱rkiɛn kɛn nɛy tin ca kuɛn, cukɛ a a nɛy ti bathdɔɔri ti kur bäkɛl wi̱cdɛ diɔ̱k wi̱cdɛ kur dhieec wi̱cdɛ dhieec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
